  "aboutParagraphs": [
    "Paseo Vista is Chandler's wide-open recreation-area course built on a former landfill — 18 holes at 4,135 feet and par 56 from the short tees, with two concrete culvert mandos adding the only real obstacles to the open ground. Eleven holes have two tees for extra variety.",
    "Free to play with concrete tees and DISCatcher baskets, it's very cart friendly and one of the friendliest rounds in the Phoenix metro. The openness makes it ideal for beginners and for practicing your distance control.",
    "A simple, sunny, welcoming course — bring a putter and enjoy the wide-open desert air."
  ],
